    "description": "President Juscelino Kubitschek, border with the sign \"BRASIL\" and Columns of the Alvorada Palace, the official residence of the President of the Republic in Brasília. Couplet \"CENTENARY JUSCELINO KUBITSCHEK\"\r\n\r\nJuscelino Kubitschek was the founder of Brasilia, which is considered his greatest achievement. The differentiated format of the external pillars of the Palácio da Alvorada gave rise to the symbol and emblem of the city and is present in the Coat of Arms of the Federal District.",
